  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.76 Scotts Bog. No person shall operate a motorboat on Scotts Bog in the town of Pittsburg.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; amd by #4826, eff 6-1-90; amd by #5177, eff 7-19-91; amd by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES: 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 402.65); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95; amd by #7021, eff 6-24-99; amd by #7286, eff 5-23-00; amd by #7798, eff 12-3-02; paragraphs (a)-(d) & (f) EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04, except for paragraphs (e) and (g); ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.61); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.69) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
